            <div xml:id="d19-a2">

                <pb facs="0086" n="60" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v01p1/pg60"/>

                <head>Annex D</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Strengthening the Policy re
                        Shipping</hi></p>
                <p>At page 12, third complete paragraph, second sentence, rewrite as follows
                    (underlined portions are new language):<anchor n="7" xml:id="d19-f1"/>
                    <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“I subscribe to the principle that such support of our merchant fleet as
                            is required for the purpose should be provided by direct means <hi
                                rendition="#italic">and that preferences in favor of American
                                bottoms for the carriage of government-financed cargoes should be
                                avoided</hi> to the greatest extent possible.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>At page 12, last complete paragraph, second sentence, rewrite as follows: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Its findings will be further reviewed within the Executive Branch <hi
                                rendition="#italic">in the light of the principles stated above</hi>
                            in order to develop etc.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
